usage: starplast-discover [-h] [--task MODE:LAYER[:AGAINST]] [--budget BUDGET]
                          [--restarts RESTARTS] [--seed SEED]
                          [--blocks BLOCKS] [--exclude EXCLUDE] [--name NAME]
                          [--prefix PREFIX] [--out OUT] [--nodes PATH]
                          [--list] [--read NAME] [--config CONFIG] [--top TOP]
                          [--quiet]

Search the space of maps for structure that predicts, without a window.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --task MODE:LAYER[:AGAINST]
                        what to search for, as mode:layer or
                        mode:layer:against -- e.g. guilt:compartment_best,
                        conjunction:compartment_best:cellcycle_phase.
                        Repeatable; each is saved separately as it finishes.
  --budget BUDGET       configurations per task (default 100)
  --restarts RESTARTS   hill-climb restarts (default 3)
  --seed SEED           random seed (default 42)
  --blocks BLOCKS       only these feature blocks, comma separated
  --exclude EXCLUDE     feature blocks to keep out (default: literature, which
                        counts study effort rather than biology)
  --name NAME           name for a single task's saved search
  --prefix PREFIX       name prefix when several tasks are given
  --out OUT             where to keep searches (default: the app's cache)
  --nodes PATH          a node table to search, if not the cached one
  --list                list saved searches and stop
  --read NAME           print the reading of a saved search and stop
  --config CONFIG       which configuration to read, 0 being the winner
                        (default 0)
  --top TOP             findings to write out (default 8)
  --quiet               only the per-task summary lines
